# Razor views

- Authenticated pages use `_Layout`. Login uses `_LayoutLogin`.
- Shells set `ViewBag.Title`, wrap content in `ng-controller`, and include `@Html.AntiForgeryToken()`.
- Do not server-render tables the Angular controller will load.
- `@section scripts` loads that page’s service then controller.
- Shared chrome lives in `_Header.cshtml` and `_Sidebar.cshtml`. Mark the current sidebar link `active`.
- Job-scoped pages show an in-page “select a job” prompt, not an empty table.
